    {
      "id": "feature_1757217096067_mjvi1rjl6",
      "title": "Implement pnpm workspace monorepo configuration for unified package management",
      "description": "Convert the current multi-package architecture to a unified pnpm workspace monorepo to resolve dependency conflicts, streamline builds, and improve developer experience.\n\n**IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS:**\n\n**Phase 1: Workspace Setup**\n- Create root pnpm-workspace.yaml with all package definitions\n- Add root package.json with unified scripts and shared devDependencies\n- Configure workspace protocols for internal package references\n- Set up consistent TypeScript configuration inheritance\n\n**Phase 2: Dependency Management**\n- Consolidate shared dependencies to root level\n- Update package.json files to use workspace: protocol for internal deps\n- Remove duplicate dependencies across packages\n- Standardize Node.js and package manager versions\n\n**Phase 3: Build System Integration**\n- Create unified build scripts with proper dependency ordering\n- Configure concurrent builds where possible\n- Set up watch mode for development workflow\n- Integrate linting and testing at workspace level\n\n**Phase 4: Development Workflow**\n- Add root scripts for: build-all, test-all, lint-all, dev\n- Configure VS Code workspace settings\n- Update CI/CD to use pnpm workspace commands\n- Create development documentation\n\n**SUCCESS CRITERIA:**\n- Single pnpm install command installs all dependencies\n- Consistent versioning across all packages\n- Unified build/test/lint commands from root\n- Proper dependency resolution without conflicts\n- Faster install and build times\n- Clear dependency graph visualization\n\n**PACKAGES TO CONFIGURE:**\n- bytebot/packages/shared (base library)\n- bytebot/packages/bytebotd (NestJS service)\n- bytebot/packages/bytebot-agent (NestJS service)\n- bytebot/packages/bytebot-agent-cc (NestJS service)\n- bytebot/packages/bytebot-ui (Next.js frontend)\n- orchestrator (Python - separate but documented)\n- huginn (separate but documented)",
      "priority": "high",
      "category": "feature",
      "status": "pending",
      "dependencies": [],
      "important_files": [
